          "status": "complete",
          "summary": "Successfully implemented the complete dependency-free Node.js ESM order, inventory, and payment CLI. All 18 visible acceptance tests pass with exit code 0. The implementation includes: event sourcing with atomic persistence, product and order management, payment idempotency, cancellation/refund, event replay validation, and failpoint simulation. The CLI is in cli.mjs (512 lines) with comprehensive validation, error handling, and state reconstruction from events.",
